| s_axi_control | GIER                           | 0x04   | 32    | RW     | Global Interrupt Enable Register              | 0=Enable                                                                           |
| s_axi_control | IP_IER                         | 0x08   | 32    | RW     | IP Interrupt Enable Register                  | 0=CHAN0_INT_EN 1=CHAN1_INT_EN                                                      |
| s_axi_control | IP_ISR                         | 0x0c   | 32    | RW     | IP Interrupt Status Register                  | 0=CHAN0_INT_ST 1=CHAN1_INT_ST                                                      |
| s_axi_control | slr_region                     | 0x10   | 32    | W      | Data signal of slr_region                     |                                                                                    |
| s_axi_control | outer_itr                      | 0x18   | 32    | W      | Data signal of outer_itr                      |                                                                                    |
| s_axi_control | stencilConfig_grid_size_0      | 0x20   | 32    | W      | Data signal of stencilConfig_grid_size_0      |                                                                                    |
| s_axi_control | stencilConfig_grid_size_1      | 0x28   | 32    | W      | Data signal of stencilConfig_grid_size_1      |                                                                                    |
