| s_axi_control | stencilConfig_total_itr        | 0x38   | 32    | W      | Data signal of stencilConfig_total_itr        |                                                                                    |
| s_axi_control | stencilConfig_outer_loop_limit | 0x40   | 32    | W      | Data signal of stencilConfig_outer_loop_limit |                                                                                    |
| s_axi_control | tile_size_x                    | 0x48   | 32    | W      | Data signal of tile_size_x                    |                                                                                    |
| s_axi_control | last_tile_size_x               | 0x50   | 32    | W      | Data signal of last_tile_size_x               |                                                                                    |
